Modifications made in this fork (GPLv3, section 5a: the work is marked as modified)
  - Output files (WZ files, IMG files, lists, manifests, indexes) are written without following symbolic links:
    see MapleLib/Helpers/NoFollowFile.cs, and the packer, extractor and ImgFileSystemManager.
  - Scratch files are written next to the output with random names instead of the working directory.
  - Image encoding and decoding work on Linux (raw pixel API, SkiaSharp) without System.Drawing.
  - List.json is written with the real ListWzJsonFormat type (it threw InvalidCastException before).
  - Further changes for running inside a container are visible in the git history:
    git log 22e32d13..HEAD
The server that uses this library, with a longer list of changes, is https://github.com/noamyoyo/WzImg-MCP-Server
(branch linux-slim), see README-LINUX.md there.
